# Ship Branch

Run the full pre-review pipeline before opening a merge request. **Not** on every `git commit` — Tier 2 is 5–15 minutes per [`dev-loops.mdc`](dev-loops.mdc).

## Command

```bash
ship-branch.cmd          # Windows launcher → WSL
bash scripts/wsl_ship_branch.sh
```

Plan worktrees (after finish gates):

```bash
source .worktree.env
bash scripts/wsl_plan_worktree_finish.sh --push --ship
```

## Pipeline order

1. Branch guard (refuse `main` / default branch)
2. Clean git tree (unless `--allow-dirty`)
3. **Tier 1** — `flutter pub get && flutter analyze && flutter test` + boot test
4. **Tier 2 smoke** — build web + docker/nginx + deep-link smoke + coverage; **tears down** docker
5. **Push** — `git push -u origin <branch>`
6. **MR** — idempotent GitLab MR to target (default `main`)

## When to use which script

| Script | Docker after | Push | MR |
|--------|--------------|------|-----|
| `dev-local.cmd` | n/a (Flutter :3000) | no | no |
| `deploy-local.cmd` | **running** on :8080 | no | no |
| `ship-branch.cmd` | **stopped** | yes | yes |

## MR target

- Default: `main` (`MR_TARGET=main`)
- Parallel sprint per-plan branches: `MR_TARGET=feat/sprint-N-integration bash scripts/wsl_ship_branch.sh`
- Assign **Ship & Story** (Kishan) for deploy validation review per [`git-hygiene.mdc`](git-hygiene.mdc)

## Agent rules

- **Never** suggest opening an MR without Tier 1 + Tier 2 green
- Before MR / merge: run `ship-branch.cmd` or `plan-worktree-finish --push --ship` in worktrees
- Do not run Tier 2 on every commit — use `dev-local.cmd` for inner loop
- `glab auth login` is one-time local setup; never commit tokens

## Flags

`--dry-run`, `--no-tier2`, `--no-mr`, `--allow-dirty`, `--yes` — see `scripts/README.md`

